request.description:
Saves user message, calls AI with last 10 messages as context, saves assistant reply.

Body: { content: string }

v1.5: Action steps + suggested links are auto-generated after EVERY message. Credits are reserved before the AI call and confirmed after (refunded on failure).

Returns: { message, generationId, action_steps[4], suggested_links[4], tokenStatus, creditStatus }

Errors: 402 if insufficient credits.

Auto-saves generation_id to collection variable for Save Output.

NEW in v1.5. Returns the current user's credit balance:
{ balance, monthlyAllowance, dailyAllowance, resetsAt, tier }

Free/Trial users reset daily (cron), paid tiers reset on billing cycle (RevenueCat webhook).

Returns a previously generated image for the current user (chat history reload).

Response: { id, imageUrl, prompt, createdAt }

Use the id from image-generation:{id} refs stored on conversation messages.

